      }), ": Identify your application's most complex or most tested user flow-typically authentication, checkout, or onboarding-and create a comprehensive flow graph for that single flow. Use a state machine library like XState or document it in structured YAML. Focus on getting one flow right before expanding to others. This provides a template and proves the value before scaling the effort."]
    }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
